Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 14:43:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 4720 CH: the profile page the server read counts as evidence
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The tester's EN seat got „TBC appointed (name not verified on an official
page) as CEO…". The server reads the public profile inside web_search,
and web_search results never become the run's evidence (D151: snippets
are not evidence), so the officeholder gate cut the person's own name
out of the reply. The page is a fetched page, as fetch_page is, so only
its text now joins the evidence; the snippets around it stay outside.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
